  "descriptionModule": {
   "briefSummary": "The purpose of this study is to compare the efficacy of Formoterol Fumarate Inhalation Solution (FFIS) 20 mcg BID to Combivent® Inhalation Aerosol \\[2 inhalations from metered dose inhaler (MDI)of 18 mcg ipratropium bromide and 103 mcg albuterol sulfate QID\\], and to Compare the preference/compliance of BID nebulization to QID use of MDI"
  },
